keymasq (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public release of Keymasq with the GTK4 app, CLI, layered profiles,
    macros, superkeys, combos, and compositor-aware desktop integration.
  * Add machine-readable `keymasq status --json` output and improve absolute
    cursor positioning plus screen-position capture workflows.
  * Rework macro recording with clearer source selection, saved recording
    preferences, and cleaner unlock handling.
  * Let Add Device and Add Input capture continue after unlocking, and remove
    obsolete CLI device and hardware commands.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Tue, 21 Apr 2026 04:21:52 +0000

keymasq (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

keymasq (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Seed a default editable profile on first startup.
  * Refine first-run device setup UX.

